// components/justBecauseData.js
// Generated content matrix for the Just Because page.
//
// 55 sisters x 7 topics = 385 messages, each with an
// English text and an Italian translation.
//
// Ids are stable and permanent: the first row of every topic keeps the id
// that was already published in Utils.js, so links shared before this matrix
// existed still resolve. The remaining variants derive their id
// deterministically from that same id plus the topic, so no randomness is
// involved at build or run time.

